<title>BELGIUM: UCB CLOSED AT 132,350 BFR - BOURSE.</title>
<headline>UCB CLOSED AT 132,350 BFR - BOURSE.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Belgian chemicals maker UCB ended trade on Friday at 132,350 francs, down nearly 11 percent on the day, a bourse official said.</p>
<p>She was asked to confirm the chemical maker's closing price after a rogue price of 139,800 francs appeared in some systems.</p>
<p>One trader said the higher price was executed in a post-market trade, but the bourse could not immediately confirm this. Another trader said he was unsure about this too.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
